{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.WenzlNormalisation","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.WenzlNormalisation","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.AddableCellIndexing","lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.StandardYoungTableauBot","lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.SYTBranchingRule"],"declarations":7,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.wenzlWeight_addCell_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.wenzlWeight_addCell_eq","kind":"theorem","line":138,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/WenzlNormalisation.lean#L138-L159","doc":"**The termwise box-addition ratio for the normalised weight.**\n\n`w_{μ+□ at row a} = (q-ratio_a / [r]_Q) · w_μ`.\n\n`sum_wenzlWeight_addCellOrSelf` sums these; the corner identity needs them one at a time, because it\nweights each by the seminormal entry before summing.  The `[r]_Q` is the one extra cell's worth of\nnormalisation, exactly as in `card_addCell`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.sum_dim_wenzlWeight_eq_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.sum_dim_wenzlWeight_eq_one","kind":"theorem","line":128,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/WenzlNormalisation.lean#L128-L136","doc":"**The normalisation, at every `n` and every level `r`.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.sum_dim_wenzlWeight_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.sum_dim_wenzlWeight_zero","kind":"theorem","line":119,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/WenzlNormalisation.lean#L119-L126","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.eq_bot_of_card_zero'","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.eq_bot_of_card_zero'","kind":"theorem","line":113,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/WenzlNormalisation.lean#L113-L117","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.sum_dim_wenzlWeight_succ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.sum_dim_wenzlWeight_succ","kind":"theorem","line":69,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/WenzlNormalisation.lean#L69-L111","doc":"**The weighted dimension sum does not depend on `n`.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.sum_addable_wenzlWeight_all","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.sum_addable_wenzlWeight_all","kind":"theorem","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/WenzlNormalisation.lean#L54-L67","doc":"**Branching, with no row-count hypothesis.**  Above `r` rows both sides are `0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.colLen_zero_le_addCell","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.colLen_zero_le_addCell","kind":"theorem","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/WenzlNormalisation.lean#L43-L52","doc":"Adding a box never lowers the row count. ","signatureChunk":0}]}